  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BUMP — re-pack contra Cayaqui.ReportModels 0.4.2 (ReportTheme movido a Cayaqui.ReportModels.Theme). Reemplaza la 0.x.2 que dependía de ReportModels 0.4.1 (binario root-namespace) y causaba CS7069/TypeLoadException.\n0.5.2 — Rebuild contra Cayaqui.Metadata 0.20.0 (refactor de namespaces: tipos movidos a Cayaqui.Metadata.Attributes/.Resolver/.Models/.Branding). Sin cambios de API propios; corrige TypeLoadException/CS7069 al consumir este paquete junto a Metadata 0.20.0.\n0.5.1 — CoverSlide: logo aspect ratio preserved (FitLogo reads PNG IHDR dims; logos right-aligned and vertically centered). 0.5.0 — CoverSlide fullscreen PPT cover; PptReportOptions.Logos; PptReport.AddCoverSlide(). 0.3.5 — R9cTableSlide: esquema R9C actualizado (Incurrido/Pagado/Trends/EAC). Requiere ReportModels ≥ 0.3.5. 0.3.4 — WaterfallSlide: color declarations refactored to use EvmChartPalette constants (WaterfallTotal, WaterfallSubtotal, Earned, Actual, Cyan, Amber). No behavioral change; guarantees color parity with web design system and ReportModels palette.\n\n0.3.3 — 6 new slides: WbsBudgetTableSlide, EngProgressTableSlide, LookaheadTableSlide, EvmControlChartSlide (SV/CV line chart), RaciMatrixSlide (pivot table), PoRegisterSlide. New PptReport fluent builder with all 24 slide methods.\n\n0.3.2 — Fix: Cayaqui.Licensing.dll incluido en lib/net10.0/ del .nupkg (faltaba en 0.3.0/0.3.1 → 502.5 en IIS).\n\n0.3.1 — Fix: re-publicación de 0.3.0 con binarios correctos. Sin diferencia de API.\n\n0.3.0 — Licensing: AddMpsPptExport acepta licenseKey opcional (ECDSA P-256). Sin clave válida, cada slide generado incluye text box de marca de agua en rojo. PptLicenseState registrado en DI. Sin breaking changes.\n\n0.2.0 — 18 slides EVM: EvmKpiStripSlide, EvmSCurveChartSlide, BurndownChartSlide, PhysicalProgressCurveSlide, ProductionCurveSlide, MonteCarloHistogramSlide, CashflowChartSlide, R9cTableSlide, RiskHeatmapSlide, ScheduleVarianceTableSlide, ContingencyDrawdownSlide, WaterfallSlide, ResourceHistogramSlide, ManagementReserveTrackerSlide, TornadoChartSlide, MilestoneStripSlide, RiskRegisterTableSlide, ChangeOrderLogSlide. 68 tests. Paridad completa con ExcelExport v0.6.0 y Cayaqui.Components.Evm. 0.1.0 — Scaffold: IPptSlideSection, IPptReportContext, PptReportContext, PptReportOptions.",
